{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world collapsing due to a ruthless corporation, an explorer and a magical being cross paths by chance\u2026 or by fate. What begins as a routine job becomes a struggle for life, identity, and the rebirth of a wounded planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/7ed1f1b2efc79a464ce84c768faddde8.avif?t=1771871233\" width=775 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the desolation appears <strong>Arty</strong>, a magical being capable of bringing light back where everything has withered. Together with him, you will have to restore what was lost and unravel the bond that could be the key to saving the planet\u2026 and saving yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine mystical powers and creative engineering to purify ecosystems, unlock abilities, and bring life back to each region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/76e73c4c1e4b65c073987d0bdef91075.poster.avif?t=1771871233\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/76e73c4c1e4b65c073987d0bdef91075.webm?t=1771871233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/76e73c4c1e4b65c073987d0bdef91075.mp4?t=1771871233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/f86275886fac608cf18690183b944971.poster.avif?t=1771871233\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/f86275886fac608cf18690183b944971.webm?t=1771871233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/f86275886fac608cf18690183b944971.mp4?t=1771871233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/13e737bc4b0e557f177b9aa56868a76c.avif?t=1771871233\" width=775 height=113 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Alex</strong>, a space explorer sent on a routine mission\u2026 until you crash on a dying planet, ravaged by the mining greed of <strong>Foundry K</strong>. Travel across toxic biomes on hovercrafts, improvise technology with scarce resources, and face the remnants of an artificial intelligence that may have lost its sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an open world full of secrets, collapsed zones, and mutated creatures waiting to be freed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/432cdf7c5a28dbcf9092d9d47be07de7.poster.avif?t=1771871233\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/432cdf7c5a28dbcf9092d9d47be07de7.webm?t=1771871233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/432cdf7c5a28dbcf9092d9d47be07de7.mp4?t=1771871233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/17bc8664eced955fd65a2f9a166c2794.poster.avif?t=1771871233\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/17bc8664eced955fd65a2f9a166c2794.webm?t=1771871233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/17bc8664eced955fd65a2f9a166c2794.mp4?t=1771871233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/a88fdb1731ff5f4b0d550188d13869cc.avif?t=1771871233\" width=775 height=113 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won\u2019t just cleanse the world\u2014you\u2019ll transform it.<br>Design and build your own spaces, repair structures sunken in decay, and reactivate forgotten technologies as you raise new hope from the ruins of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/028b84e041d862333f7f59486d271c13.poster.avif?t=1771871233\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/028b84e041d862333f7f59486d271c13.webm?t=1771871233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/028b84e041d862333f7f59486d271c13.mp4?t=1771871233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/8b9ede8576e86dec6a5289112644b782.poster.avif?t=1771871233\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854800/extras/8b9ede8576e86dec6a5289112644b782.webm?t=1771871233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akama